ount":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Tour Planner\n\nThe Tour Planner intelligently creates a personalized city tour based on the user's mood, interests, and location. It fetches live data from Wikipedia, WeatherAPI, and SerpAPI, and uses RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) to generate relevant travel plans. Wikipedia content is semantically chunked, embedded using Sentence Transformers, and indexed with FAISS for efficient retrieval. A Gemini LLM, orchestrated via LangChain, combines weather conditions, user preferences, and retrieved knowledge to generate a friendly, context-aware tour plan. The tour plan includes activities, sights, food suggestions, and cultural highlights, all tailored to the user's input.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"#### Imports","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import requests\nimport os\nimport json\nimport faiss\nimport numpy as np\nimport nltk\n\nfrom sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\nfrom langchain_google_genai import GoogleGenerativeAIEmbeddings, ChatGoogleGenerativeAI\nfrom langchain_community.utilities import SerpAPIWrapper\nfrom langchain.tools import Tool\nfrom langchain.agents import initialize_agent, AgentType\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\nfrom nltk.tokenize import sent_tokenize\n\ntry:\n    nltk.data.find('tokenizers/punkt')\nexcept LookupError:\n    nltk.download('punkt')","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-04-21T03:38:23.82869Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-04-21T03:38:23.82914Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-04-21T03:38:23.889414Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-04-21T03:38:23.829098Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-04-21T03:38:23.88855Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"code","source":"llm = ChatGoogleGenerativeAI(model ='gemini-2.0-flash', google_api_key = google_api_key)","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-04-21T03:38:31.313005Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-04-21T03:38